<title>USA: Allegany Cty, Md., won by Ferris Baker.</title>
<headline>Allegany Cty, Md., won by Ferris Baker.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ferris Baker Watts said it won $6.680 million of Allegany Cty, Md., public improvement bonds, 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.1367 percent.</p>
